1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Open the Listen panel for a table read.

2
00:00:10,025 --> 00:00:19,025
Choose a reading mode and range.

3
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:29,130
Quick Read uses an optional local voice pack. Set up a voice engine before playing.

4
00:00:30,234 --> 00:00:39,234
Review the character voice assignments.

5
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:49,240
Adjust playback speed and pauses to suit the read.

6
00:00:50,245 --> 00:00:59,245
Use Play to start the chosen range.

7
00:01:00,350 --> 00:01:09,350
The panel also offers options to save or export the read.
